+        <p class="takeaway"><span class="label">Takeaway</span>A regression on ΔP (the error in MethaneSAT's retrieved surface pressure), aerosol and albedo couldn't separate aerosol from albedo effects without knowing true CO₂, which pointed me toward physics-based modeling.</p>
